\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">This is WarIR! a AI sandbox game where you pit Artificial intelligence against each other to fight to the death! (for educational reasons of course). And build arenas for them to fight in.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzk2MjA2Ni5naWY=/original/yKIEcg.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">How does the AI work?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Every time they die they remember why they died, and every time they get a kill they remember what got them that kill. so through trial and error and maturing they go from wall shooting idiots to 360 no scoping MLG pro&#x27;s</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzk2MjA3NC5naWY=/original/V6P6uI.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">What&#x27;s the gameplay like?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Gameplay consist of creating arenas and having the little guys fighting to the death. it takes a little while for them to learn but u can speed up time to let them train faster. This is a good game for when your doing work and you want to come back to see something entertaining when you are done or if u just have no idea what u want to do and you just wanna zone out to watching AI mindlessly kill each other. more of a calm relaxing game then an action game.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzk2MjA3Ny5naWY=/original/Tl6stw.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"6\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.93